	(text "J19 expansion port (Rev C)\nEXP_Pn_P/N: bank 66 HP, VCCO 1.8 V. LVDS in/out, 1.8 V LVCMOS. NOT 3.3 V tolerant.\n14 pairs: P0-P4, P6-P13, P17.  GC (clock-capable): P0=L12, P10=L11.\nSingle-ended 1.8 V: EXP_IO18_0-2, EXP_P14_N, EXP_P16_P.  3.3 V (bank 26 HD): EXP_IO33_0/1/3/4/5.\nUnrouted positions are NC on both ends.  Bank 66 VRP (G4) left free for DCI.\nPower: +3V3 x3, +12V x3 (raw input, daughterboard makes its own rails), GND x2 (pins 59-60), GND via G1-G4 blade.\nMates Samtec QSH-030-01-L-D-A: 11 mm stack."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1cbf338e-8811-45a1-97c4-1049e761e326")
	)
	(text "Daughter-card standoffs: M3 x 11 mm hex, female-female (= J19 11 mm mated stack).\nPlated pads tied to GND. H8-H11: place at the daughter-card corners."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a808ba0f-2bb8-4075-8c96-cd2654331106")
	)
